Oil — per-brush licensing

This package bundles 4 brush tips that were previously published as separate
packages. Each tip keeps the licence it was published under; the manifest's `license` field lists
every licence present. The text of each tip's licence follows, verbatim except that the tip's path
is its path in this package. A tip's own terms apply to that tip alone.

==============================================================================
Filbert  (assets/oil-filbert.png)  —  CC-BY-4.0
==============================================================================

CC BY 4.0 (Attribution)

The brush tip bitmap in this package (assets/oil-filbert.png) is used under the
Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International license:
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

Tip artwork by David Revoy (davidrevoy.com), from the Krita 4 Extras brush preset pack (CC BY 4.0).
Source: https://www.davidrevoy.com/article742/krita-4-extras-brush-presets-pack
Changes made: inverted to a grayscale-alpha PNG and packaged as an azphalt
brush asset. No other changes were made to the artwork.

The manifest, packaging code, and this LICENSE file are
Copyright (c) 2026 HereLiesAz. All rights reserved.

